{"id":"98e3ecc63869d9fc","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-slln-ml.md","title":"Martin-Löf 随机序列的大数定律","display":"thm-slln-ml — Martin-Löf 随机序列的大数定律","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-slln-ml","aliases":["43-thm-slln-ml"],"display":"thm-slln-ml — Martin-Löf 随机序列的大数定律","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-church-stochastic]]","[[43-thm-random-stochastic]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.1大数定律讨论，印刷173，PDF193；§12.1 Theorem 12.1.3，印刷327，PDF347","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-slln-ml"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-slln-ml</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-slln-ml — Martin-Löf 随机序列的大数定律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00b50f9887ef4bac\" href=\"?note=00b50f9887ef4bac\" title=\"43-df-church-stochastic\">43-df-church-stochastic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f06ef5177a12879\" href=\"?note=1f06ef5177a12879\" title=\"43-thm-random-stochastic\">43-thm-random-stochastic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.1大数定律讨论，印刷173，PDF193；§12.1 Theorem 12.1.3，印刷327，PDF347"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i&lt;n}X(i)=\\frac12.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i&lt;n}X(i)=\\frac12.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取恒为1的可计算选择规则，应用随机性蕴含选择频率稳定；也可由Hoeffding尾界构造Solovay检验。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.1大数定律讨论，印刷173，PDF193；§12.1 Theorem 12.1.3，印刷327，PDF347。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-church-stochastic","status":"resolved","id":"00b50f9887ef4bac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-church-stochastic]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-random-stochastic","status":"resolved","id":"1f06ef5177a12879","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-random-stochastic]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\lim_{\\substack{n\\to\\infty\\\\n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}}}\\frac1n\\sum_{i<n}X(i)=\\frac12.","display":true}],"bytes":1180,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-slln-ml]] — Martin-Löf 随机序列的大数定律"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","00b50f9887ef4bac","1f06ef5177a12879"]}